<project xml:id="cool-unAlgoritmoUOtraEstrategia-2" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude"> 

<title>¿Un algoritmo u otra estrategia?</title>

<statement>
  <p>¿Cómo encontrarías el valor de <m>700-599</m>? Explica tu razonamiento.</p>
</statement>

<solution>
    <p>[+++++++++++++++]</p>
    <p>Sample response: I would use a counting-up strategy because the numbers are both so close to hundreds that it would be a lot faster to count up than to use an algorithm.</p>
  </solution>


